# Grid

A 2D sortable grid — drag tiles to reorder within a responsive CSS Grid layout.

Set `direction="grid"` on `DndDroppable` and lay the container out with `display: grid`. Drop zones are computed row-by-row from the actual item rects, so items with different sizes and wrapping rows work out of the box.

